{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Your quests, progress and logs": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your quests, progress and logs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To answer a question, Memoir sends it with your quests and their history, your hero's progress, your money, meals, side quests and general metrics to %@. %@ processes them under its own terms.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To answer a question, Memoir sends it with your quests and their history, your hero's progress, your money, meals, side quests and general metrics to %@. %@ processes them under its own terms."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your journal and reflections": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your journal and reflections"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With this, Memoir also sends your journal entries, your reflections and the reasons you noted for quests to %@. Without it, none of them is read for a question.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this, Memoir also sends your journal entries, your reflections and the reasons you noted for quests to %@. Without it, none of them is read for a question."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your health and activity data": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your health and activity data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With this, Memoir also sends your health and activity data, such as weight, sleep, heart rate, steps and workouts, to %@. Without it, none of them is read for a question.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this, Memoir also sends your health and activity data, such as weight, sleep, heart rate, steps and workouts, to %@. Without it, none of them is read for a question."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
